# Host build artefacts must never enter the image: a copied .venv carries symlinks to the
# host's Python and silently replaces the one built inside, which then fails at runtime.
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.env
**/.git/
data/
**/data/
*.duckdb
*.zip
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
.DS_Store
